  "caveats": [
    "NW030's POS sync is lagging: sales are only through 2026-09-11, 3 business days missing (last sync error: connection timeout), so September sales are incomplete.",
    "NW030 is a newly opened store (opened 2026-09-01, 14 days open), so its sell-through is flagged as a new store (DR-011)."
  ],
  "explanation": "The warehouse has no sell-through definition, so I used units sold divided by units available. For NW030 in September 2026, 8,621 base units were sold, out of 36,744 received (opening stock plus receipts), which gives 23.46%. Inventory on hand at the snapshot (27,111) doesn't reconcile exactly with receipts minus sales, so the result depends on this definition."
}
